      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 0,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 0,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『唔．公主殿下，您為何．",
              "　為何要帶這些人來加害",
              "　陛下．．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 1,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 1,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『萊汀，我怎麼會想要加害",
              "　父王！宮中到底發生了",
              "　什麼事？』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 2,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 2,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『．前幾天有刺客夜襲陛下的",
              "　寢宮，想要抓走陛下，幸好",
              "　打鬥聲驚動了侍衛，"
            ],
            [
              "　衛兵衝進來救駕，陛下才倖",
              "　免於難．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 3,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 3,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『有這種事？！說下去！』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 4,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 4,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『刺客臨走前還揚言，",
              "　幾天之內一定會再來．．",
              "　陛下遭到這種驚嚇，"
            ],
            [
              "　幾天來一直在床上休義．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 5,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 5,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 0,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『這件事又為何會扯到我們",
              "　身上？』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 6,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 6,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『為了搜查可疑份子，我們在",
              "　王國各地派出調查隊，結果",
              "　又發現了不少怪事，例如普"
            ],
            [
              "　里茲港的失蹤事件，而你們",
              "　又惹上了調查隊，結果．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 7,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 7,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『大臣們一致認為我們就是刺",
              "　客？這太荒謬了！』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 8,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 8,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『葛雷大人相當支持這種說法",
              "　所以命令我們禁衛軍派兵攻",
              "　擊你們．．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 9,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 9,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『不是父王下令的嗎？怎麼又",
              "　變成葛雷了？』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34af0",
        "native_text_index": 2,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 2,
          "line": 10,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 2,
          "utterance": 10,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『陛下多日來一直臥病在床，",
              "　軍令方面都是經由葛雷大人",
              "　發佈．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "spawn_group",
        "groups": [
          1
        ],
        "act_immediately": true,
        "native_spawns": [
          {
            "group": 1,
            "via": "spawn_group",
            "source": "0x34b17",
            "raw_placement_gate": 0
          }
        ],
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 0,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 0,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 34,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『禁衛軍隊長萊汀，想不到你",
              "　竟敢和盜匪勾結，我們奉葛",
              "　雷大人之命將你逮捕！"
            ],
            [
              "　趕快束手就擒吧！』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 1,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 1,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『可惡，我明白了，葛雷這個",
              "　該死的叛徒．．』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 2,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 2,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『萊汀，照這樣看來，父王處",
              "　境危險，我們先設法殺進去",
              "　再說！』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 3,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 3,
          "control": "FFED",
          "operand": 11,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『殿下，屬下被奸人所騙，",
              "　有負保護陛下的使命，",
              "　請讓屬下和你們一起去！』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 4,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 4,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『你受傷這麼重，還是先．．",
              "　』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 5,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 5,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 0,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『喂！希莉亞，現在情況緊急",
              "　我看這傢伙蠻能打的，叫瑪",
              "　琳用法術給他治一下傷就可"
            ],
            [
              "　以上陣了，應該可以多少幫",
              "　上點忙吧！』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
        "native_dialogue_ref": {
          "script": "assets/story/ch09.json",
          "scene_index": 3,
          "line": 6,
          "source_dat": "FDTXT_009",
          "string_index": 3,
          "utterance": 6,
          "control": "FFEE",
          "operand": 8,
          "pages": [
            [
              "『索爾，你說話也客氣點．．",
              "　』"
            ]
          ]
        },
        "native_event_id": 30
      },
      {
        "type": "dialogue",
        "native_source": "0x34b21",
        "native_text_index": 3,
